WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:08.833 --> 00:00:11.169
I'm quite far from the city.
This should suffice.

2
00:00:11.878 --> 00:00:13.838
After all. nobody knows what might happen.

3
00:00:15.423 --> 00:00:16.508
<i>Job-change quest.</i>

4
00:00:17.592 --> 00:00:20.929
<i>This quest appeared
when I reached level 40.</i>

5
00:00:22.180 --> 00:00:25.850
<i>There have been two dungeons
that are opened with keys.</i>

6
00:00:26.476 --> 00:00:29.062
<i>Aside from penalties and urgent quests.</i>

7
00:00:29.604 --> 00:00:32.565
<i>this is the first time
the system directly intervenes.</i>

8
00:00:34.234 --> 00:00:36.903
<i>And this quest
is different from the others.</i>

9
00:00:36.986 --> 00:00:39.698
<i>I can choose whether to accept
and when to start.</i>

10
00:00:40.448 --> 00:00:42.617
<i>Does it suggest it's that challenging?</i>

11
00:00:43.868 --> 00:00:45.328
<i>Generally speaking.</i>

12
00:00:45.412 --> 00:00:48.373
<i>this quest should reward me
with professional skills.</i>

13
00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:52.544
<i>I can become stronger.</i>

14
00:00:56.047 --> 00:00:56.881
Yes.

15
00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:04.074
Do you want subtitles for any video?
-=[ ai.OpenSubtitles.com ]=-

16
00:01:09.769 --> 00:01:11.813
{\an8}Damn. I haven't completed
the daily quest yet.

17
00:01:12.897 --> 00:01:14.566
{\an8}Fine. I'll do it when I get back.

18
00:01:15.608 --> 00:01:16.818
All right.

19
00:01:16.901 --> 00:01:20.405
I finally feel like the game has started.

20
00:01:21.030 --> 00:01:23.908
I wonder what awaits me inside.

21
00:01:25.034 --> 00:01:26.077
How exciting.

22
00:03:19.107 --> 00:03:20.441
Sorry. I'm late.

23
00:03:21.192 --> 00:03:23.528
No. you are right on time. Jinsung.

24
00:03:24.571 --> 00:03:26.698
Long time no see. Jinho.

25
00:03:27.198 --> 00:03:28.074
Brother.

26
00:03:32.912 --> 00:03:34.956
This dungeon is more ordinary
than I imagined.

27
00:03:38.793 --> 00:03:41.421
I can't use potions
and Full Recovery here?

28
00:03:42.046 --> 00:03:44.757
{\an8}I can't leave until I complete it.

29
00:03:45.550 --> 00:03:47.385
{\an8}I have to be cautious.

30
00:03:58.813 --> 00:04:00.356
An armor-type monster?

31
00:04:18.291 --> 00:04:19.375
<i>My attack has no effect?</i>

32
00:04:35.016 --> 00:04:35.892
It's useless?

33
00:04:39.520 --> 00:04:40.980
Enemies with a hard shell...

34
00:04:47.904 --> 00:04:49.322
I've faced them before!

35
00:04:59.165 --> 00:05:01.334
I wasted a Fatal Strike.

36
00:05:02.168 --> 00:05:04.712
Here. neither my injury
nor my mana will recover.

37
00:05:06.130 --> 00:05:06.965
However...

38
00:05:08.258 --> 00:05:11.719
{\an8}Of course you guys don't care. do you?

39
00:05:15.556 --> 00:05:16.724
What's the matter. Jinho?

40
00:05:17.225 --> 00:05:19.644
You're not eating.

41
00:05:19.727 --> 00:05:21.104
Ah. nothing.

42
00:05:22.522 --> 00:05:23.523
Jinsung.

43
00:05:23.606 --> 00:05:25.608
How's the progress with the guild?

44
00:05:26.109 --> 00:05:30.822
I've heard that S-rank hunters
have refused to join.

45
00:05:31.489 --> 00:05:35.785
Indeed. Min Byung-gu and Cha Hae-In
both declined our invitation.

46
00:05:35.868 --> 00:05:37.078
But it doesn't affect our plan.

47
00:05:37.996 --> 00:05:42.458
We are negotiating with hunters
from Europe and the Middle East.

48
00:05:43.835 --> 00:05:46.421
They will join us
if we offer enough money.

49
00:05:46.504 --> 00:05:48.840
After all. there's the precedent
set by Hunter Hwang Dongsoo.

50
00:05:48.923 --> 00:05:49.757
That's true.

51
00:05:50.425 --> 00:05:52.719
<i>Abroad... I see.</i>

52
00:05:55.513 --> 00:05:56.347
Jinho.

53
00:05:58.141 --> 00:06:01.060
I know you are up to something.

54
00:06:01.936 --> 00:06:04.522
You've been bidding high prices
for numerous C-rank raid missions

55
00:06:04.605 --> 00:06:06.983
to try to make your achievements.

56
00:06:07.483 --> 00:06:09.944
It doesn't matter if it's for fun.
but remember...

57
00:06:11.529 --> 00:06:13.156
don't get in my way.

58
00:06:17.910 --> 00:06:20.246
<i>Brother doesn't know how strong Jinwoo is.</i>

59
00:06:20.997 --> 00:06:22.665
<i>With Jinwoo's strength.</i>

60
00:06:22.749 --> 00:06:23.750
<i>I can...</i>

61
00:06:32.550 --> 00:06:34.802
I'm getting tired from fighting non-stop.

62
00:06:35.720 --> 00:06:36.721
Now I can take a break...

63
00:06:39.766 --> 00:06:40.641
Stealth?

64
00:06:41.934 --> 00:06:43.728
They even know how to use Stealth?

65
00:06:47.482 --> 00:06:49.400
Next is a mage.

66
00:06:49.484 --> 00:06:51.402
And he's using flash magic.

67
00:06:51.986 --> 00:06:53.738
Stealth and flash magic.

68
00:06:53.821 --> 00:06:54.947
What's with this place?

69
00:06:55.656 --> 00:06:56.783
That hard shell like Kasaka's...

70
00:06:57.366 --> 00:07:00.161
<i>It's like a review of my past battles.</i>

71
00:07:03.289 --> 00:07:05.416
This quest is harder than I thought.

72
00:07:07.460 --> 00:07:10.463
<i>I must use different abilities to deal
with different types of monsters.</i>

73
00:07:11.464 --> 00:07:14.133
<i>I should use strength for knights.
perception for assassins.</i>

74
00:07:14.217 --> 00:07:15.385
<i>and agility for archers.</i>

75
00:07:17.095 --> 00:07:19.764
<i>Without strength. I can't damage knights.</i>

76
00:07:22.725 --> 00:07:25.520
<i>If my perception is too low.
I can't detect assassins.</i>

77
00:07:27.188 --> 00:07:28.773
<i>But the bigger problem</i>

78
00:07:28.856 --> 00:07:29.941
<i>is the mage.</i>

79
00:07:30.566 --> 00:07:33.111
<i>They should be dealt with intelligence.</i>

80
00:07:33.194 --> 00:07:35.196
<i>Sadly. I haven't invested much
in intelligence.</i>

81
00:07:35.863 --> 00:07:37.532
<i>As a result. my mana is insufficient.</i>

82
00:07:37.615 --> 00:07:39.409
<i>Although I want to conserve my skills...</i>

83
00:07:43.413 --> 00:07:45.206
{\an8}<i>my fatigue is accumulating.</i>

84
00:07:45.790 --> 00:07:47.208
<i>I need to finish this quickly.</i>

85
00:07:59.804 --> 00:08:02.932
So. is everyone here?

86
00:08:04.976 --> 00:08:06.060
Finally.

87
00:08:15.987 --> 00:08:17.864
Even a thing like this is valuable.

88
00:08:17.947 --> 00:08:20.032
Fortunately. I could get some
from monsters.

89
00:08:23.536 --> 00:08:25.538
High-rank knight's chestplate?

90
00:08:26.122 --> 00:08:28.708
Right. I've never tried on the equipment.

91
00:08:34.338 --> 00:08:36.591
They can turn invisible?

92
00:08:36.674 --> 00:08:38.676
Great. The equipment
doesn't change my appearance.

93
00:08:41.053 --> 00:08:42.847
Nor do they hinder my movements.

94
00:08:43.931 --> 00:08:46.559
It's hard to feel that
since I can't use Full Recovery now.

95
00:08:47.059 --> 00:08:48.269
but I've leveled up.

96
00:08:49.270 --> 00:08:51.189
I obtained some items and gold coins

97
00:08:51.898 --> 00:08:53.441
and my fatigue has also recovered.

98
00:08:54.317 --> 00:08:57.403
It should be about time I move on.

99
00:09:05.745 --> 00:09:06.579
Okay.

100
00:09:07.371 --> 00:09:11.083
{\an8}How strong will my opponent
behind this door be?

101
00:09:15.838 --> 00:09:19.258
{\an8}<i>Since I can't leave without defeating him.
I have to go forward.</i>

102
00:09:26.933 --> 00:09:28.893
<i>This terrifying aura.</i>

103
00:09:47.578 --> 00:09:48.996
Is this the king's hall?

104
00:09:57.004 --> 00:10:00.174
<i>My eyes. ears. fingertips...</i>

105
00:10:00.967 --> 00:10:02.468
<i>and my whole body remember this.</i>

106
00:10:03.427 --> 00:10:07.014
<i>the same aura I felt
in the double dungeon.</i>

107
00:10:13.229 --> 00:10:15.106
<i>The source of this astonishing aura</i>

108
00:10:16.148 --> 00:10:17.024
<i>is him?</i>

109
00:10:18.609 --> 00:10:20.820
<i>"Knight Commander. Igris the Bloodred."</i>

110
00:10:22.029 --> 00:10:23.364
<i>His name is in crimson.</i>

111
00:10:24.615 --> 00:10:27.285
<i>He's obviously on a different level
from the other beasts.</i>

112
00:10:29.203 --> 00:10:31.581
<i>A knight who defends the empty throne.</i>

113
00:10:38.546 --> 00:10:39.380
<i>He's coming.</i>

114
00:10:48.139 --> 00:10:51.225
<i>He chops pillars
as easily as snapping a twig.</i>

115
00:11:00.109 --> 00:11:01.944
<i>Being strong is an understatement.</i>

116
00:11:13.372 --> 00:11:15.750
{\an8}<i>He wears such cumbersome armor.
yet he moves so fast.</i>

117
00:11:16.834 --> 00:11:17.960
<i>He's incredibly strong.</i>

118
00:11:29.597 --> 00:11:30.973
{\an8}<i>I can't cut through.</i>

119
00:11:44.653 --> 00:11:46.197
<i>I can reach his speed.</i>

120
00:11:46.739 --> 00:11:48.366
<i>but he's extremely destructive.</i>

121
00:11:50.117 --> 00:11:51.994
<i>My dagger can't penetrate his armor.</i>

122
00:11:52.995 --> 00:11:55.456
<i>Can I really defeat him?</i>

123
00:11:57.083 --> 00:11:59.126
<i>A strong enemy beyond my imagination.</i>

124
00:12:00.044 --> 00:12:00.878
<i>However...</i>

125
00:12:02.296 --> 00:12:04.465
I don't think I can defeat you unarmed.

126
00:12:05.424 --> 00:12:08.010
but this is the only way
to cause internal damage

127
00:12:08.552 --> 00:12:09.845
through the armor.

128
00:12:17.812 --> 00:12:19.355
Is this what they call chivalry?

129
00:12:20.731 --> 00:12:22.400
You underestimate me?

130
00:12:27.405 --> 00:12:28.239
Come in.

131
00:12:29.365 --> 00:12:31.992
President. are you not going home yet?

132
00:12:32.493 --> 00:12:34.161
I don't want to go back yet.

133
00:12:34.787 --> 00:12:37.748
So I stayed to handle some other work.

134
00:12:37.832 --> 00:12:38.916
Same for me.

135
00:12:39.542 --> 00:12:42.044
I've completed extra work too.

136
00:12:44.422 --> 00:12:45.548
It's finally starting.

137
00:12:48.384 --> 00:12:49.802
Speaking of the devil.

138
00:12:50.845 --> 00:12:53.222
It's me. Are you setting off now?

139
00:12:53.305 --> 00:12:54.140
<i>Yes.</i>

140
00:12:54.223 --> 00:12:56.434
I want to thank you first

141
00:12:56.517 --> 00:13:00.563
for agreeing to this operation.

142
00:13:01.063 --> 00:13:02.606
<i>You don't need to thank me.</i>

143
00:13:03.190 --> 00:13:06.444
{\an8}This is the result of you repeatedly
mentioning the Jeju Island incident

144
00:13:06.527 --> 00:13:09.697
{\an8}on TV interviews and magazine features.

145
00:13:10.281 --> 00:13:12.783
That's how the public
remembered the tragedy.

146
00:13:12.867 --> 00:13:14.910
and their attitude was changed.

147
00:13:15.870 --> 00:13:19.582
I am simply adding
a bit of momentum to the tide.

148
00:13:20.082 --> 00:13:22.835
<i>Won't they criticize you
for looking for trouble?</i>

149
00:13:23.419 --> 00:13:25.296
I'm well-prepared for that.

150
00:13:25.963 --> 00:13:27.381
But you must be careful.

151
00:13:27.465 --> 00:13:29.300
Jeju Island is a dangerous area.

152
00:13:29.800 --> 00:13:31.635
<i>I know that very well.</i>

153
00:13:32.219 --> 00:13:34.263
Our mission this time is reconnaissance.

154
00:13:34.847 --> 00:13:38.684
We'll launch a minor attack
to probe the enemy's strength and size.

155
00:13:39.226 --> 00:13:41.437
<i>I admire your effort.</i>

156
00:13:41.937 --> 00:13:44.190
The third Jeju Island raid mission.

157
00:13:44.982 --> 00:13:47.151
for me.

158
00:13:48.694 --> 00:13:50.738
{\an8}is still not over.

159
00:13:59.997 --> 00:14:00.998
<i>He's fast.</i>

160
00:14:24.814 --> 00:14:26.232
<i>I was on the defensive.</i>

161
00:14:26.315 --> 00:14:28.567
<i>but I think I still lost
500 points of vitality.</i>

162
00:14:29.568 --> 00:14:31.529
<i>It was the right decision to wear armor.</i>

163
00:14:32.988 --> 00:14:35.825
<i>If he had hit me directly.
I could have been killed on the spot.</i>

164
00:14:36.992 --> 00:14:39.078
<i>He has such strength even without a sword.</i>

165
00:14:39.745 --> 00:14:40.913
<i>He's too strong.</i>

166
00:14:44.375 --> 00:14:46.752
<i>If I can't match his strength.</i>

167
00:14:46.836 --> 00:14:48.379
<i>I'll increase my speed.</i>

168
00:15:05.938 --> 00:15:06.856
<i>I can't catch up.</i>

169
00:15:13.696 --> 00:15:15.948
<i>The passive skill
has increased my defense.</i>

170
00:16:33.567 --> 00:16:34.568
That should do it.

171
00:17:29.331 --> 00:17:30.207
I...

172
00:17:31.834 --> 00:17:32.793
I haven't

173
00:17:33.711 --> 00:17:36.964
lost yet!

174
00:17:58.527 --> 00:18:00.070
<i>That dagger cannot be transferred.</i>

175
00:18:00.696 --> 00:18:02.197
<i>It will go back into the inventory.</i>

176
00:18:02.281 --> 00:18:03.323
<i>and come back to me!</i>

177
00:18:06.994 --> 00:18:07.870
<i>I stabbed too shallow.</i>

178
00:18:07.953 --> 00:18:09.079
<i>I need to stab deeper.</i>

179
00:18:38.609 --> 00:18:40.944
I won... right?

180
00:18:46.033 --> 00:18:48.035
That was really close.

181
00:18:50.829 --> 00:18:52.664
<i>I was lucky to defeat him.</i>

182
00:18:53.290 --> 00:18:56.335
<i>In terms of skill. strength.
and experience.</i>

183
00:18:56.919 --> 00:18:59.671
<i>I am not his match in any aspect.</i>

184
00:19:00.422 --> 00:19:02.174
If I had made a mistake.
I would have died.

185
00:19:03.759 --> 00:19:05.636
Four rewards?

186
00:19:06.220 --> 00:19:08.680
A pouch carrying 1.500.000 gold coins.

187
00:19:09.389 --> 00:19:12.601
The same helmet as Igris'.

188
00:19:12.684 --> 00:19:14.103
It's an S-rank item!

189
00:19:14.978 --> 00:19:17.189
The Demon Castle's Key is also S-rank.

190
00:19:17.272 --> 00:19:20.150
but this is my first S-rank gear.

191
00:19:21.360 --> 00:19:23.821
It reduces physical damage by 15%

192
00:19:23.904 --> 00:19:26.657
and increases vitality and strength
by another 20 points.

193
00:19:26.740 --> 00:19:27.783
That's awesome.

194
00:19:28.659 --> 00:19:31.245
And the stone Ruler's Hand.

195
00:19:31.829 --> 00:19:32.955
What kind of skill is this?

196
00:19:34.081 --> 00:19:35.415
Never mind. I'll find out later.

197
00:19:37.543 --> 00:19:38.585
Aside from those...

198
00:19:39.336 --> 00:19:40.796
Instant teleportation stone?

199
00:19:41.755 --> 00:19:43.549
It can't go back into the inventory.

200
00:19:44.216 --> 00:19:46.927
Why does it appear now?

201
00:19:49.054 --> 00:19:49.930
Is it because

202
00:19:50.597 --> 00:19:52.266
this job-change quest

203
00:19:53.183 --> 00:19:55.018
is still not over?

204
00:20:02.985 --> 00:20:05.654
The longer I hold out. the more points?

205
00:20:06.155 --> 00:20:07.531
What's a high-class job?

206
00:20:10.450 --> 00:20:12.452
"Good luck"?

207
00:20:13.996 --> 00:20:15.247
An infinite number of enemies?

208
00:20:20.836 --> 00:20:22.880
<i>If they are of Igris' level.</i>

209
00:20:22.963 --> 00:20:25.007
<i>I might not last even a few seconds.</i>

210
00:20:26.008 --> 00:20:29.052
<i>But my current ability is
more than enough for these ones.</i>

211
00:20:29.970 --> 00:20:32.431
<i>But. there are too many.</i>

212
00:20:48.363 --> 00:20:49.531
<i>Damn it.</i>

213
00:20:49.615 --> 00:20:50.991
<i>No matter how many I kill.</i>

214
00:20:51.074 --> 00:20:53.160
<i>they keep coming out of the gate.</i>

215
00:20:55.204 --> 00:20:57.623
<i>The key to this quest
is how long I can hold out.</i>

216
00:20:58.123 --> 00:20:58.957
<i>In that case...</i>

217
00:21:01.668 --> 00:21:03.545
<i>Activating Stealth takes 200 mana.</i>

218
00:21:04.171 --> 00:21:06.215
<i>Afterwards. it costs one mana per second.</i>

219
00:21:07.966 --> 00:21:09.218
{\an8}<i>I have 190 mana left.</i>

220
00:21:10.052 --> 00:21:12.429
<i>I must buy as much time as possible.</i>

221
00:21:16.892 --> 00:21:18.352
<i>My Stealth has been detected?</i>

222
00:21:27.986 --> 00:21:29.279
<i>I didn't expect that.</i>

223
00:21:29.863 --> 00:21:31.865
<i>Both Stealth and Murderous Intent
are now useless.</i>

224
00:21:38.789 --> 00:21:39.623
<i>How long has it been?</i>

225
00:21:40.958 --> 00:21:42.334
<i>Only five minutes?</i>

226
00:21:43.001 --> 00:21:44.211
<i>I have no chance.</i>

227
00:21:44.294 --> 00:21:46.255
<i>I'll have to use the teleportation stone.</i>

227
00:21:47.305 --> 00:22:47.885
